<!-- @opening -->
<p class="story-lead">The catalog is ready, but the home screen is still waiting for a slow promo service. Moving orchestration into a BFF does not decide whether optional data may hold the screen hostage.</p>

<!-- @before 2. The BFF Implementation :: animation -->
### Bound the optional dependency

